    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Dark and Magical World, Free Exploration and Combat Players will embark on an adventure in a vast world filled with monsters and secrets. The game features highly customizable characters, dynamic skill combinations, and the flexible switching between idle combat and manual operation, providing players with a dual experience of &quot;one-click smooth gameplay + in-depth strategy&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Rich Class System Currently, there are 4 main classes and multiple advanced classes available, with a wealth of build options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Core Gameplay: Idle Combat and Endless Challenges Idle System: It supports idle combat and resource accumulation. Players can easily level up and obtain equipment, freeing their hands and enjoying the adventure. Randomly generated maps, side quests, and world events mean that every piece of land may hide surprises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Abundant Systems: Create a Personalized Character Talents and Advanced Classes: There are over a hundred skills that can be freely combined, and it supports multi-directional class advancement, such as warrior, mage, assassin, etc. Each choice affects the combat style and growth path. Equipment and Weapons: A rich variety of weapons and equipment drop randomly, and they can be enhanced. Each piece of equipment can acquire unique attributes through combat.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Dark and Magical World, Free Exploration and Combat Players will embark on an adventure in a vast world filled with monsters and secrets. The game features highly customizable characters, dynamic skill combinations, and the flexible switching between idle combat and manual operation, providing players with a dual experience of &quot;one-click smooth gameplay + in-depth strategy&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Rich Class System Currently, there are 4 main classes and multiple advanced classes available, with a wealth of build options. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Core Gameplay: Idle Combat and Endless Challenges Idle System: It supports idle combat and resource accumulation. Players can easily level up and obtain equipment, freeing their hands and enjoying the adventure. Randomly generated maps, side quests, and world events mean that every piece of land may hide surprises. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Abundant Systems: Create a Personalized Character Talents and Advanced Classes: There are over a hundred skills that can be freely combined, and it supports multi-directional class advancement, such as warrior, mage, assassin, etc. Each choice affects the combat style and growth path. Equipment and Weapons: A rich variety of weapons and equipment drop randomly, and they can be enhanced. Each piece of equipment can acquire unique attributes through combat.</p>",
